    show it, then, if it is a "Flower Cardian" monster, you can take 1 "Flower Cardian"
    monster from your Deck, except "Flower Cardian Cherry Blossom", and either add
    it to your hand or Special Summon it. Otherwise, send the card you drew to the
    GY.'
